  "articleBody": "An attached ADU can be a game-changer for your property, but it's also a significant construction project with unique challenges. We've seen homeowners make common errors that can lead to delays, unexpected costs, or an ADU that just doesn't quite hit the mark. Steer clear of these pitfalls to ensure your attached ADU project in Los Angeles is a smooth success.",
